BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventadaptivemonstermash23834-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261023T145227Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Adaptive Monster Mash
DESCRIPTION:This program is designed for people ages 16+ with intellectual and developmental disabilities to enhance their social skills and expand their communication skills. Join us as we take part in various activities throughout the community. Come dressed in your favorite costume! Snacks and games will be provided Essential Eligibility: Program levels 1 - 3. Difficulty with terrain. May use assistive and/or self-propelled device as listed in Level 2\, plus powered wheelchair or scooter. Maintains personal hygiene with some assistance. Can follow instructions with assistance. Able to convey feelings\, desires and needs with picture cues or communication device. Demonstrates age-appropriate social and emotional skills in managing personal boundaries\, relationships\, communication\, stress\, and conflict with assistance. Will stay with group with continuous supervision. Can manage the sensory stimulation of occasionally large\, loud\, and energetic group environment with assistance. If a participant needs personal care\, a caregiver must remain onsite. Advanced registration is required. Registrations will not be accepted at the door. There will be no drop ins.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/adaptive-monster-mash/23834/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventalleynights23158-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261023T145227Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Alley Nights
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Alley Nights — your Saturday night destination in Downtown Frederick. With three bars open\, the party moves wherever the night takes you! Start in our newly renovated Main Bar\, catch the DJ spinning in Terrace\, or head upstairs to the rooftop bar for drinks and views of downtown Frederick. Add late-night bites\, great music\, and a lively crowd — and you’ve got everything you need for the perfect Saturday night! Benefactor Events joins us every first and third Saturday of the month to get the party going in Terrace! Meet us at Alley Nights! No cover | 21+ event.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/alley-nights/23158/
END:VEVENT
