DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:America 250: Echoes on the Water
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate America's 250th Through Music. Join the Frederick Catoctones for an unforgettable afternoon celebrating the people\, places\, and waterways that helped shape our nation over the past 250 years. Featuring the Frederick Children's Chorus\, Secret Best Friends (2025 Mid-Atlantic District Quartet Champions)\, and Catoctones quartets Remnants and Chordians of the Galaxy\, this concert blends powerful storytelling\, rich harmonies\, and outstanding musicianship into a celebration the whole family will enjoy. What You'll Experience: • A unique musical journey celebrating America's 250th Anniversary • Inspiring performances from outstanding guest ensembles and quartets • Barbershop harmony\, contemporary favorites\, and timeless classics • Beautiful acoustics and comfortable seating at Frederick Church of the Brethren • Free on-site parking Your attendance supports local music\, youth education\, and community singing throughout Frederick.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/america-250%3a-echoes-on-the-water/26221/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventartnightindowntownbrunswick26273-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261023T145227Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Art Night in Downtown Brunswick
DESCRIPTION:Art gallery openings\, artist talks\, and entertainment at Smoketown Brewing! The art gallery events are free\, and several artists will be present to answer questions about their work. After enjoying the art galleries\, check out Smoketown Brewing for their concert and music events\, and try their latest craft brews! Gilded Dragonfly Gallery is a brand-new gallery specializing in hand-crafted jewelry and fine artisan crafts. They're hosting a grand opening celebration with light food and beverages! You will also have the opportunity to meet the artists represented at the gallery! Located at 27 W. Potomac Street. 5- 7 p.m. Lockhouse Gallery will host an artist talk and reception for Neo-Expressionist artist Sam Gross! He will take questions\, read poetry\, and give away a few of his small paintings\, with a drawing for attendees. Light food\, wine\, and beverages will be served. Located at 17 W. Potomac St.\, 6- 9 p.m. Roots & River Gallery will open to show Kathleen Howsare's amazing paintings and to meet her\, who will answer questions about her work. Ron Batcher's and Vicki Michael's work is also on display. Located at 30 W. Potomac St.\, 4:30-7 p.m. All of these galleries are right next to each other\, and Smoketown Brewing is two blocks away. These are casual events\, so no need to dress up. Come enjoy our great art in Downtown Brunswick!!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/art-night-in-downtown-brunswick/26273/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventbiginkprintmakingdemo26093-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261023T145227Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:BIG INK Printmaking Demo
DESCRIPTION:Visitors are invited to watch the printing process during the BIG INK printmaking workshop taking place at The Delaplaine Arts Center from 2–4 PM each day\, Oct 24 and 25. BIG INK will also set up The Anchovy\, a small press used to produce 2″ x 3″ mini prints\, which are complimentary for visitors. FREE
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/big-ink-printmaking-demo/26093/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventbangles26brews26203-20261024@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261023T145227Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261025
SUMMARY:Bangles & Brews
DESCRIPTION:Join Kris Reifel\, the artisan behind KMR Original Jewelry\, in this beginner-friendly workshop. You will design a beautiful stacked memory wire bracelet using your choice of beads and colors to create a one-of-a-kind piece. Choose from Kris's classic materials collection\, along with seasonal color and charm options. All tools and materials will be provided\, and no complicated techniques are required. Each participant will also receive a charm to attach to your bracelet\; an included Sandbox Brewhouse beer\, NA\, or soda\; and a relaxing\, cozy workshop experience. Limited seats\, so reserve your spot now!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/bangles-%26-brews/26203/
END:VEVENT
